<title>POLAND: Farm Food rights first leg 94 pct taken.</title>
<headline>Farm Food rights first leg 94 pct taken.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors subscribed for 562,722 shares in the first subscription period of the 600,000-share rights issue of Polish meat processing firm Farm Food SA, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Farm Food has said a second period would take place from February 13 to 27 if the first phase was not fully subscribed.</p>
<p>The rights issue is priced at 33 zlotys per share. The stock closed on the bourse's main market on Tuesday at 46.2 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
